<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 51 0 R/T(Mediation Mastery, an executive 5-day mediation training program developed in collaboration with the Pakistan Mediation Association \(PMA\) and supported by the International Mediation Institute \(IMI\). This program is designed to equip participants with advanced conflict resolution skills and techniques necessary for effective mediation, making them highly sought-after professionals in the field.)/E(Mediation Mastery, an executive 5-day mediation training program developed in collaboration with the Pakistan Mediation Association \(PMA\) and supported by the International Mediation Institute \(IMI\). This program is designed to equip participants with advanced conflict resolution skills and techniques necessary for effective mediation, making them highly sought-after professionals in the field.)/Pg 9 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

69 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 51 0 R/T(Led by four CEDR-accredited master trainers, Mediation Mastery offers an intensive, hands-on curriculum that balances theoretical learning with practical application. Participants will engage in dynamic workshops, realistic role-play exercises, and comprehensive assessments to become fully accredited mediators. Upon successful completion, trainees will receive PMA certification, recognized for its high standards and international collaboration.)/E(Led by four CEDR-accredited master trainers, Mediation Mastery offers an intensive, hands-on curriculum that balances theoretical learning with practical application. Participants will engage in dynamic workshops, realistic role-play exercises, and comprehensive assessments to become fully accredited mediators. Upon successful completion, trainees will receive PMA certification, recognized for its high standards and international collaboration.)/Pg 9 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

